## Interface: 16001
## Title: MacroForge
## Notes: Creates/updates macros from a generated data file. /mf applies, /mf live applies without reload, /mf ask sends a request to the PC watcher, /mf ui (or the minimap button) opens a window with the same actions, /mf export, /mf probe, /mf petcheck.
